From 1d346e362834538448cb030fbba716e725ee96aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 16:06:44 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Quiz translation module (detachable) +
 courses.monday_board_id

src/modules/quiz: reads a course's quiz questions from its Monday board
("Quiz Questions" group), translates question + answers per language
(glossary, formality, TRUE/FALSE fixed words, optional Claude check) and
writes <LANG>/Quiz Questions/<course> Quiz Questions <LANG>.xlsx to the
course's Box folder. Stateless; runs as a "quiz" course job. Plugged in with
one line in app.ts. Course details and import accept mondayBoardId.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019SfrJH4SbgPjULJKHTAFnx
